5-1459）统治时期， 是该市现存的最古老的砖结构建筑。","see":"穆加尔人以精心布置的花园，清真寺，宫殿和堡垒为城市装饰。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1354","articleTitle":"达卡","sourceRevision":91760195,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 达卡","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%BE%E5%8D%A1"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91760195"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1354"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159151473","name":"吉大港","country":"BGD","lat":22.33194,"lon":91.79802,"kind":"city","region":"BD-B","rank":2,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"吉大港 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"吉大港位于，戈尔诺普利河畔，总面积157平方公里。\n整个市区蔓延在周边的丘陵地带上，一直延伸到印度。\n从1969年开始这里也从事拆船业，这个行业主要集中在离吉大港西北约20千米的一个16千米长的海岸线上。","culture":"2006年诺贝尔和平奖的得主、小额贷款的先驱、孟加拉乡村银行的建立人穆罕默德·尤纳斯出生在吉大港。\n从内地来的船只主要贸易棉花、米、香料、糖和烟草。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q376749","articleTitle":"吉大港","sourceRevision":89194023,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 吉大港","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%89%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%AF"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89194023"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q376749"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150353","name":"库尔纳","country":"BGD","lat":22.84193,"lon":89.55805,"kind":"city","region":"BD-D","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"库尔纳 · 地点概要","geo":"该城位于孟加拉国首都达卡之西南方约333千米，是主要的工商业中心。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q243325","articleTitle":"库尔纳","sourceRevision":89194017,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese convert